[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20959.27, "timestamp": "05:49:19", "text": "層。等等。虛線灰灰漸層藍粉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20962.948, "timestamp": "05:49:22", "text": "是的。 CSS 值。複製到這裡。提交。控制這個。好的。漸變。漸變漸變。約翰。呃，藍，藍，紫。我覺得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20965.03, "timestamp": "05:49:25", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20967.59, "timestamp": "05:49:27", "text": "應該先"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20973.11, "timestamp": "05:49:33", "text": "發布一下，以確保全域路由不會離開我，或者以防萬一，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20977.51, "timestamp": "05:49:37", "text": "因為我不想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20981.91, "timestamp": "05:49:41", "text": "再做一次。是的，我這就發布。所以，如果我沒記錯的話，我們可以在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20983.67, "timestamp": "05:49:43", "text": "doc.space"}]